    "long_instructions": "## Analyze Patterns\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Look through the `animals` array.\r\n2. Count how many animals of each `species` appear.\r\n3. Look at the `gender` field across the dataset.\r\n4. Compare the `bio` field across animals.\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n- Which type of animal appears most often?\r\n- Which type appears least?\r\n- What patterns do you notice in the gender of the animals?\r\n- Which animals have more detailed bios? Which have less?",
